When the user asks about their Tablin jobs, candidates or screening, use the tablin server: call desk_status with pluginVersion "3.0.0" first, and call guide_read on demand. Use applications_search for scores and reasons, screen_candidates to screen, and candidates_search with query for CV-wide search. Confirm before a delete, merge, bulk change or billed run. Writes update the open lists live. Do not paste a key.
